              </div>
              <p>Emerging, fading, and resurfacing are local trend labels—not explanations for why your interests changed.</p>
            </div>
            <div class="evolution-switcher" role="tablist" aria-label="Evolution evidence">
              <Control as="button" variant="outline" selection="primary" type="button" role="tab" data-evolution="topics" aria-selected="true">Topics</Control>
              <Control as="button" variant="outline" selection="primary" type="button" role="tab" data-evolution="domains" aria-selected="false">Question domains</Control>
              <Control as="button" variant="outline" selection="primary" type="button" role="tab" data-evolution="language" aria-selected="false">Language signals</Control>
            </div>
            <div class="evolution-grid">
              <div>
                <div id="evolution-list" class="evolution-list">
                  <p class="empty-note">Evolution routes appear after analysis.</p>
                </div>
              </div>
              <aside class="memory-change-board" aria-labelledby="memory-change-heading">
                <div class="lens-detail-heading">
                  <div>
                    <p class="map-key">Statements that moved</p>
                    <h3 id="memory-change-heading">Memory changes</h3>
                  </div>
